// SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
//! Graph runtime: wires node entries, transport, and scheduler together.
//!
//! Runtime internals, not node-author API. `cerulion graph run` builds and
//! drives a `GraphRuntime` from `graphs/<name>.yaml` and the built node
//! libraries; the framework's own tests build one directly. A node author
//! writes neither a `main` nor a call into this module.
//!
//! # Execution Model
//!
//! `GraphRuntime::step()` performs:
//! 1. Pre-step drain: check all data-triggered subscriber inputs
//! 2. Bridge received data to `scheduler.signal_data()`
//! 3. Call `scheduler.step(delta)` to evaluate triggers and fire nodes
//!
//! # Transport
//!
//! `build()` wires every topic over iceoryx2 shared memory (cross-process
//! capable). It requires a caller-owned `TransportManager`.

